                                                "sense_id": "fa6e2088-4ee9-3e77-892a-71f020c36baa",
                                                "text": "The US Securities and Exchange Commission has closed its insider trading investigation into stock trades made by then-Sen. Richard Burr and his brother-in-law at the outset of the pandemic, the former senator announced Friday."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
